{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint","id":1459581,"title":"Help Question about Harmony Breakpoint","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-10T14:23:47-07:00","id":1459581,"title":"Help Question about Harmony Breakpoint","content":"Hello im start a new chronicle of Wtf <br /> <br /> And i want know how the best way of use the Breaking points Harmony with human Kills <br /> <br /> Well i use the BPF with the Uratha kill human or eat inocent people (folowing the principle os Oath of the Moon &quot;do not eat flesh of the man&quot;)<br /> <br /> And i use the BPS against Uratha if he kill dangerous humans, armed like hunters for example or in autodefense against criminais, ghouls, corrupted cops and others scums (i belive in this way to describe the uratha reaction in the form of &quot;Spiritual Apex Predator&quot; behavior)<br /> <br /> I dont no <br /> My interpretation is wrong?<br /> <br /> Eating or kill human is a oathbreak and a Breaking point of Flesh or the spiritual apex predator behavior (Breaking point of Spirit)?<br /> <br /> I want opinions and examples of your games <br /> <br /> Thanks and sorry for idiom errors <br /> <br /> WtF is my favorite game actually and i start a chronicle 1 week ago","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12210,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12210-ulisses","user":"Ulisses","date":". 09-10-2021, 05:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12210-ulisses","name":"Ulisses","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T14:37:02-07:00","id":1459583,"title":"","content":"Killing humans is a breaking point towards the spirit. The spirit is the more predatory half of the werewolf, powerful but dangerous. The breaking point largely doesn't care about the &quot;morality&quot; of the killing, but hunting humans specifically for their flesh imposes a dice penalty to the breaking point roll. Page 104 lists the Harmony breaking points.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T14:55:08-07:00","id":1459588,"title":"","content":"But is a oathbreak right?<br /> A violation of Oath of The Moon (BPF)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12210-ulisses","name":"Ulisses","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T14:59:12-07:00","id":1459589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ulisses</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint?p=1459588#post1459588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But is a oathbreak right?<br /> A violation of Oath of The Moon (BPF)</div> </div> </div> </div>Eating humans is, but you can kill humans without eating them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T15:41:17-07:00","id":1459594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint?p=1459589#post1459589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eating humans is, but you can kill humans without eating them.</div> </div> </div> </div>But eating human is a Breaking point for Spirit and Flesh too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12210-ulisses","name":"Ulisses","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T17:30:58-07:00","id":1459600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ulisses</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint?p=1459594#post1459594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But eating human is a Breaking point for Spirit and Flesh too?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Unfortunately yes. Eating human or wolf flesh is a breaking point towards Spirit (and getting there usually involves other breaking points towards Spirit) while violating the Oath of the Moon is a breaking point towards Flesh, so it is a violation in both directions.<br /> <br /> In our game, we don't roll any breaking points until the end of the scene, or sometimes the end of the session. If you have multiple breaking points in one direction, we just make a single roll with an increased penalty. If you have breaking points in both directions, you roll both (and we count them as having occurred at the same time i.e. if you have a penalty to one roll due to particularly high or low harmony you don't get to avoid that by rolling the other check first).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2384-aurumae","name":"Aurumae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T17:48:31-07:00","id":1459601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ulisses</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint?p=1459594#post1459594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But eating human is a Breaking point for Spirit and Flesh too?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, provided you've sworn the Oath. If you're not at Harmony 5, one of those is going to have a penalty on it on top of the penalty from the breaking point itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T17:55:24-07:00","id":1459602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint?p=1459601#post1459601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep, provided you've sworn the Oath. If you're not at Harmony 5, one of those is going to have a penalty on it on top of the penalty from the breaking point itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel obliged to point out the &quot;Oath reflects physio-spiritual facts&quot; rather than &quot;Oath imposes physio-spiritual facts&quot; conversation from years ago. While some oaths do impact how a werewolf do be*, some were facts of life before the Oath was forged.<br /> <br /> I'll find the link later, but point is that eating people being a Harmony problem is <i>probably</i> just part and parcel of being an Uratha.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T19:05:16-07:00","id":1459605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint?p=1459602#post1459602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel obliged to point out the &quot;Oath reflects physio-spiritual facts&quot; rather than &quot;Oath imposes physio-spiritual facts&quot; conversation from years ago. While some oaths do impact how a werewolf do be*, some were facts of life before the Oath was forged.<br /> <br /> I'll find the link later, but point is that eating people being a Harmony problem is <i>probably</i> just part and parcel of being an Uratha.</div> </div> </div> </div>Point being, of course, that eating people is only a breaking point in <i>both</i> directions for werewolves who've sworn the Oath and thereby aligned their Harmony with a spiritually-backed institution; otherwise it's solely a breaking point toward spirit like regular human-killing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T19:59:22-07:00","id":1459614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1459581-help-question-about-harmony-breakpoint?p=1459605#post1459605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div clas